<title>USA: CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 751 contracts.</title>
<headline>CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 751 contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Board of Trade said its Project A overnight agricultural trading volume totaled 751 contracts versus 366 overnight Tuesday.</p>
<p>There were 30 wheat, 187 corn, 384 soybean, 143 soymeal, six soyoil and one rice contract traded.</p>
<p>In overnight activity, wheat was steady to 1/2 cent higher, corn was 1/4 lower to 1/4 higher and soybeans were steady to 3/4 cent lower.</p>
<p>((Sam Nelson 312-408-8721))</p>
</text>
